type_name\":\"DOUBLE\",\"position\":37,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"temperature\",\"type_text\":\"double\",\"type_name\":\"DOUBLE\",\"position\":38,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"temperature_dew_point\",\"type_text\":\"double\",\"type_name\":\"DOUBLE\",\"position\":39,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"temperature_heat_index\",\"type_text\":\"double\",\"type_name\":\"DOUBLE\",\"position\":40,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"temperature_realfeel\",\"type_text\":\"double\",\"type_name\":\"DOUBLE\",\"position\":41,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"temperature_realfeel_shade\",\"type_text\":\"double\",\"type_name\":\"DOUBLE\",\"position\":42,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"temperature_wind_chill\",\"type_text\":\"double\",\"type_name\":\"DOUBLE\",\"position\":43,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"visibility\",\"type_text\":\"double\",\"type_name\":\"DOUBLE\",\"position\":44,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"wind_direction\",\"type_text\":\"double\",\"type_name\":\"DOUBLE\",\"position\":45,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"wind_gust\",\"type_text\":\"double\",\"type_name\":\"DOUBLE\",\"position\":46,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"wind_gust_instantaneous\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":47,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"wind_speed\",\"type_text\":\"double\",\"type_name\":\"DOUBLE\",\"position\":48,\"nullable\":true}]},{\"name\":\"historical_hourly_metric\",\"catalog_name\":\"samples\",\"schema_name\":\"accuweather\",\"table_type\":\"MANAGED\",\"comment\":\"View [listing on Databricks Marketplace.](/marketplace/consumer/listings/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001) \\nThese datasets are a sample collection of AccuWeather's enriched and comprehensive daily, 12-hour day-night, and hourly historical weather parameters. The sample contains one month of data for the top 50 global cities. Please note that this sample dataset represents a reduced portion of the available data attributes, volume, and data types available within AccuWeather's Data Suite and is intended for exploratory purposes rather than for production.\\n\\nSome examples these datasets can be explored include:\\n- Compare weather conditions across the top 50 global cities to identify regional patterns in temperature, precipitation, and other weather parameters.\\n- Create visualizations like time series plots, heatmaps, or box plots to better understand the distribution and weather variability.\\n- Explore correlations between different weather parameters within and across cities to understand how they are related.\\n- Investigate temporal trends by analyzing how weather fluctuates over time.\\n- Identify outliers in the data that could indicate extreme weather occurrences.\\n\\nWith more access to AccuWeather's Data Suite available on the Databricks Marketplace, users can leverage weather information in a number of ways which include some of the following:\\n\\n- **Economic Risk \\u0026 Impact Analysis**: Utilize historical weather data to determine relationships on business metrics that are trained to predict potential impacts, such as supply chain disruptions, labor productivity, and transportation delays.\\n- **Energy Demand Planning \\u0026 Forecasting**: Inform energy supply and production forecasts for wind, solar, and hydro installations by integrating historical weather information helping to optimize resource allocation and reduce operational risks.\\n- **Revenue Projections \\u0026 Consumer Behavior Analysis**: Join historical weather data with past business data to create more accurate sales growth predictions, accounting for weather-driven demand.\\n- **Weather-Targeted Advertising**: Craft advertising campaigns by using historical and forecast weather data to reach consumers at the most critical times, maximizing interest and increasing conversion.\",\"columns\":[{\"name\":\"city_name\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"country_code\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":1,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"latitude\",\"type_text\":\"double\",\"type_name\":\"DOUBLE\",\"position\":2,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"longitude\",\"type_text\":\"double\",\"type_name\":\"DOUBLE\",\"position\":3,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"datetime_valid_local\",\"type_text\":\"timestamp\",\"type_name\":\"TIMESTAMP\",\"position\":4,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"gmt_offset\",\"type_text\":\"double\",\"type_name\":\"DOUBLE\",\"position\":5,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"cloud_base_height\",\"type_text\":\"int\",\"type_name\":\"INT\",\"position\":6,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"cloud_cover_high\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":7,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"cloud_cover_low\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":8,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"cloud_cover_medium\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":9,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"cloud_cover_total\",\"type_text\":\"double\",\"type_name\":\"DOUBLE\",\"position\":10,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"humidity_relative\",\"type_text\":\"double\",\"type_name\":\"DOUBLE\",\"position\":11,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"index_uv\",\"type_text\":\"double\",\"type_name\":\"DOUBLE\",\"position\":12,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"has_ice\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":13,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"ice_lwe\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":14,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"ice_lwe_rate\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":15,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"minutes_of_ice\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":16,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"minutes_of_precipitation\",\"type_text\":\"int\",\"type_name\":\"INT\",\"position\":17,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"minutes_of_sun\",\"type_text\":\"int\",\"type_name\":\"INT\",\"position\":18,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"minutes_of_rain\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":19,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"minutes_of_snow\",\"type_text\":\"int\",\"type_name\":\"INT\",\"position\":20,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"has_precipitation\",\"type_text\":\"boolean\",\"type_name\":\"BOOLEAN\",\"position\":21,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"precipitation_lwe\",\"type_text\":\"double\",\"type_name\":\"DOUBLE\",\"position\":22,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"precipitation_lwe_rate\",\"type_text\":\"double\",\"type_name\":\"DOUBLE\",\"position\":23,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"precipitation_type\",\"type_text\":\"int\",\"type_name\":\"INT\",\"position\":24,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"precipitation_type_desc\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":25,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"pressure\",\"type_text\":\"double\",\"type_name\":\"DOUBLE\",\"position\":26,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"pressure_msl\",\"type_text\":\"double\",\"type_name\":\"DOUBLE\",\"position\":27,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"has_rain\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":28,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"rain_lwe\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":29,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"rain_lwe_rate\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":30,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"snow_cover\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":31,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"snow_depth\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":32,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"has_snow\",\"type_text\":\"boolean\",\"type_name\":\"BOOLEAN\",\"position\":33,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"snow\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":34,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"snow_lwe\",\"type_text\":\"double\",\"type_name\":\"DOUBLE\",\"position\":35,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"snow_lwe_rate\",\"type_text\":\"double\",\"type_name\":\"DOUBLE\",\"position\":36,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"solar_irradiance\",\"type_text\":\"double\",\"type_name\":\"DOUBLE\",\"position\":37,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"solar_radiation_net\",\"type_text\":\"double\",\"type_name\":\"DOUBLE\",\"position\":38,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"temperature\",\"type_text\":\"double\",\"type_name\":\"DOUBLE\",\"position\":39,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"temperature_dew_point\",\"type_text\":\"double\",\"type_name\":\"DOUBLE\",\"position\":40,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"temperature_heat_index\",\"type_text\":\"double\",\"type_name\":\"DOUBLE\",\"position\":41,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"temperature_realfeel\",\"type_text\":\"double\",\"type_name\":\"DOUBLE\",\"position\":42,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"temperature_realfeel_shade\",\"type_text\":\"double\",\"type_name\":\"DOUBLE\",\"position\":43,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"temperature_wind_chill\",\"type_text\":\"double\",\"type_name\":\"DOUBLE\",\"position\":44,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"visibility\",\"type_text\":\"double\",\"type_name\":\"DOUBLE\",\"position\":45,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"wind_direction\",\"type_text\":\"double\",\"type_name\":\"DOUBLE\",\"position\":46,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"wind_gust\",\"type_text\":\"double\",\"type_name\":\"DOUBLE\",\"position\":47,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"wind_gust_instantaneous\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":48,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"wind_speed\",\"type_text\":\"double\",\"type_name\":\"DOUBLE\",\"position\":49,\"nullable\":true}]}]}"}
