| {"status":200,"contentType":"application/json","body":"{\"tables\":[{\"name\":\"media_customer_reviews\",\"catalog_name\":\"samples\",\"schema_name\":\"bakehouse\",\"table_type\":\"MANAGED\",\"comment\":\"The **Bakehouse Dataset** simulates a bakery franchise business and contains several key datasets for various analytical and AI-driven use cases. Please note that this sample dataset has been synthetically curated and is suitable for any Databricks workload.\\n\\nSample use cases for this dataset include:\\n\\n* **Building Data Pipelines with Delta Live Tables**: Create automated, real-time data pipelines for efficient data ingestion, transformation, and management.\\n* **Performing Analytics with Databricks SQL**: Conduct powerful SQL-based analytics to uncover actionable insights from structured data, including sales trends and customer behavior.\\n* **Exploring AI and Machine Learning Capabilities**: Use the dataset to develop and train machine learning models, applying AI to forecast trends, optimize operations, and predict customer preferences.\",\"columns\":[{\"name\":\"review\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"franchiseID\",\"type_text\":\"bigint\",\"type_name\":\"LONG\",\"position\":1,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"review_date\",\"type_text\":\"timestamp\",\"type_name\":\"TIMESTAMP\",\"position\":2,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"new_id\",\"type_text\":\"int\",\"type_name\":\"INT\",\"position\":3,\"nullable\":true}]},{\"name\":\"media_gold_reviews_chunked\",\"catalog_name\":\"samples\",\"schema_name\":\"bakehouse\",\"table_type\":\"MANAGED\",\"comment\":\"The **Bakehouse Dataset** simulates a bakery franchise business and contains several key datasets for various analytical and AI-driven use cases. Please note that this sample dataset has been synthetically curated and is suitable for any Databricks workload.\\n\\nSample use cases for this dataset include:\\n\\n* **Building Data Pipelines with Delta Live Tables**: Create automated, real-time data pipelines for efficient data ingestion, transformation, and management.\\n* **Performing Analytics with Databricks SQL**: Conduct powerful SQL-based analytics to uncover actionable insights from structured data, including sales trends and customer behavior.\\n* **Exploring AI and Machine Learning Capabilities**: Use the dataset to develop and train machine learning models, applying AI to forecast trends, optimize operations, and predict customer preferences.\",\"columns\":[{\"name\":\"franchiseID\",\"type_text\":\"int\",\"type_name\":\"INT\",\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"review_date\",\"type_text\":\"timestamp\",\"type_name\":\"TIMESTAMP\",\"position\":1,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"chunked_text\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":2,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"chunk_id\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":3,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"review_uri\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":4,\"nullable\":true}]},{\"name\":\"sales_customers\",\"catalog_name\":\"samples\",\"schema_name\":\"bakehouse\",\"table_type\":\"MANAGED\",\"comment\":\"The **Bakehouse Dataset** simulates a bakery franchise business and contains several key datasets for various analytical and AI-driven use cases. Please note that this sample dataset has been synthetically curated and is suitable for any Databricks workload.\\n\\nSample use cases for this dataset include:\\n\\n* **Building Data Pipelines with Delta Live Tables**: Create automated, real-time data pipelines for efficient data ingestion, transformation, and management.\\n* **Performing Analytics with Databricks SQL**: Conduct powerful SQL-based analytics to uncover actionable insights from structured data, including sales trends and customer behavior.\\n* **Exploring AI and Machine Learning Capabilities**: Use the dataset to develop and train machine learning models, applying AI to forecast trends, optimize operations, and predict customer preferences.\",\"columns\":[{\"name\":\"customerID\",\"type_text\":\"bigint\",\"type_name\":\"LONG\",\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"first_name\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":1,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"last_name\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":2,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"email_address\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":3,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"phone_number\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":4,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"address\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":5,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"city\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":6,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"state\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":7,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"country\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":8,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"continent\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":9,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"postal_zip_code\",\"type_text\":\"bigint\",\"type_name\":\"LONG\",\"position\":10,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"gender\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":11,\"nullable\":true}]},{\"name\":\"sales_franchises\",\"catalog_name\":\"samples\",\"schema_name\":\"bakehouse\",\"table_type\":\"MANAGED\",\"comment\":\"The **Bakehouse Dataset** simulates a bakery franchise business and contains several key datasets for various analytical and AI-driven use cases. Please note that this sample dataset has been synthetically curated and is suitable for any Databricks workload.\\n\\nSample use cases for this dataset include:\\n\\n* **Building Data Pipelines with Delta Live Tables**: Create automated, real-time data pipelines for efficient data ingestion, transformation, and management.\\n* **Performing Analytics with Databricks SQL**: Conduct powerful SQL-based analytics to uncover actionable insights from structured data, including sales trends and customer behavior.\\n* **Exploring AI and Machine Learning Capabilities**: Use the dataset to develop and train machine learning models, applying AI to forecast trends, optimize operations, and predict customer preferences.\",\"columns\":[{\"name\":\"franchiseID\",\"type_text\":\"bigint\",\"type_name\":\"LONG\",\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"name\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":1,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"city\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":2,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"district\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":3,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"zipcode\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":4,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"country\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":5,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"size\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":6,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"longitude\",\"type_text\":\"double\",\"type_name\":\"DOUBLE\",\"position\":7,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"latitude\",\"type_text\":\"double\",\"type_name\":\"DOUBLE\",\"position\":8,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"supplierID\",\"type_text\":\"bigint\",\"type_name\":\"LONG\",\"position\":9,\"nullable\":true}]},{\"name\":\"sales_suppliers\",\"catalog_name\":\"samples\",\"schema_name\":\"bakehouse\",\"table_type\":\"MANAGED\",\"comment\":\"The **Bakehouse Dataset** simulates a bakery franchise business and contains several key datasets for various analytical and AI-driven use cases. Please note that this sample dataset has been synthetically curated and is suitable for any Databricks workload.\\n\\nSample use cases for this dataset include:\\n\\n* **Building Data Pipelines with Delta Live Tables**: Create automated, real-time data pipelines for efficient data ingestion, transformation, and management.\\n* **Performing Analytics with Databricks SQL**: Conduct powerful SQL-based analytics to uncover actionable insights from structured data, including sales trends and customer behavior.\\n* **Exploring AI and Machine Learning Capabilities**: Use the dataset to develop and train machine learning models, applying AI to forecast trends, optimize operations, and predict customer preferences.\",\"columns\":[{\"name\":\"supplierID\",\"type_text\":\"bigint\",\"type_name\":\"LONG\",\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"name\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":1,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"ingredient\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":2,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"continent\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":3,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"city\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":4,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"district\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":5,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"size\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":6,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"longitude\",\"type_text\":\"double\",\"type_name\":\"DOUBLE\",\"position\":7,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"latitude\",\"type_text\":\"double\",\"type_name\":\"DOUBLE\",\"position\":8,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"approved\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":9,\"nullable\":true}]},{\"name\":\"sales_transactions\",\"catalog_name\":\"samples\",\"schema_name\":\"bakehouse\",\"table_type\":\"MANAGED\",\"comment\":\"The **Bakehouse Dataset** simulates a bakery franchise business and contains several key datasets for various analytical and AI-driven use cases. Please note that this sample dataset has been synthetically curated and is suitable for any Databricks workload.\\n\\nSample use cases for this dataset include:\\n\\n* **Building Data Pipelines with Delta Live Tables**: Create automated, real-time data pipelines for efficient data ingestion, transformation, and management.\\n* **Performing Analytics with Databricks SQL**: Conduct powerful SQL-based analytics to uncover actionable insights from structured data, including sales trends and customer behavior.\\n* **Exploring AI and Machine Learning Capabilities**: Use the dataset to develop and train machine learning models, applying AI to forecast trends, optimize operations, and predict customer preferences.\",\"columns\":[{\"name\":\"transactionID\",\"type_text\":\"bigint\",\"type_name\":\"LONG\",\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"customerID\",\"type_text\":\"bigint\",\"type_name\":\"LONG\",\"position\":1,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"franchiseID\",\"type_text\":\"bigint\",\"type_name\":\"LONG\",\"position\":2,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"dateTime\",\"type_text\":\"timestamp\",\"type_name\":\"TIMESTAMP\",\"position\":3,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"product\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":4,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"quantity\",\"type_text\":\"bigint\",\"type_name\":\"LONG\",\"position\":5,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"unitPrice\",\"type_text\":\"bigint\",\"type_name\":\"LONG\",\"position\":6,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"totalPrice\",\"type_text\":\"bigint\",\"type_name\":\"LONG\",\"position\":7,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"paymentMethod\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":8,\"nullable\":true},{\"name\":\"cardNumber\",\"type_text\":\"bigint\",\"type_name\":\"LONG\",\"position\":9,\"nullable\":true}]}]}"}
