orted bits. For DECIMAL the number of digits, NULL otherwise.\"},{\"name\":\"numeric_precision_radix\",\"type_text\":\"int\",\"type_name\":\"INT\",\"position\":13,\"nullable\":true,\"comment\":\"For DECIMAL 10, for all other numeric types 2, NULL otherwise.\"},{\"name\":\"numeric_scale\",\"type_text\":\"int\",\"type_name\":\"INT\",\"position\":14,\"nullable\":true,\"comment\":\"For integral numeric types 0, for DECIMAL the number of digits to the right of the decimal point, NULL otherwise.\"},{\"name\":\"datetime_precision\",\"type_text\":\"int\",\"type_name\":\"INT\",\"position\":15,\"nullable\":true,\"comment\":\"For DATE 0, for TIMESTAMP, and INTERVAL … SECOND 6, any other INTERVAL 0, NULL otherwise.\"},{\"name\":\"interval_type\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":16,\"nullable\":true,\"comment\":\"For INTERVAL the unit portion of the interval, e.g. 'YEAR TO MONTH', NULL otherwise.\"},{\"name\":\"interval_precision\",\"type_text\":\"int\",\"type_name\":\"INT\",\"position\":17,\"nullable\":true,\"comment\":\"Always NULL, reserved for future use.\"},{\"name\":\"maximum_cardinality\",\"type_text\":\"long\",\"type_name\":\"LONG\",\"position\":18,\"nullable\":true,\"comment\":\"Always NULL, reserved for future use.\"},{\"name\":\"routine_body\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":19,\"nullable\":false,\"comment\":\"The routine body, 'SQL' or 'EXTERNAL'.\"},{\"name\":\"routine_definition\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":20,\"nullable\":true,\"comment\":\"The full definition of the routine. NULL if the user is not the owner.\"},{\"name\":\"external_name\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":21,\"nullable\":true,\"comment\":\"Always NULL, reserved for future use.\"},{\"name\":\"external_language\",\"type_text\":\"string\",\"type_name\":\"STRING\",\"position\":22,\"nullable\":true,\"comment\":\"The routine language, 'SQL' or 'Python' or 'FeatureSpec' or NULL.